# Public (anon) Supabase credentials for the Vault reader.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* values are inlined into the JS bundle at build time — they are
# PUBLIC by design (anon key + RLS), but still never commit a filled-in .env.
#
# Local dev:   cp .env.example .env  and fill in from the Supabase dashboard
#              (Project Settings → API). Same values apps/web uses, different
#              prefix (EXPO_PUBLIC_ instead of NEXT_PUBLIC_).
# EAS builds:  set these as EAS environment variables instead (per profile):
#              eas env:create --scope project --environment preview \
#                --name EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL --value https://<ref>.supabase.co
#              (see docs/mobile-shipping-checklist.md)
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
